<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Govt outlook unchanged despite GDP slowdown.</title>
<headline>Czech Govt outlook unchanged despite GDP slowdown.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Prime Minister Vaclav Klaus said his economic outlook was unchanged despite figures released on Wednesday showing second quarter real gross domestic product growth slowing to 4.0 percent from a revised 4.6 percent in the first quarter.</p>
</text>
